{"words": [{"text": "وَلَمَّا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "بَرَزُوا۟", "translation": "they went forth"}, {"text": "لِجَالُوتَ", "translation": "to (face) Jalut"}, {"text": "وَجُنُودِهِۦ", "translation": "and his troops"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "they said"}, {"text": "رَبَّنَآ", "translation": "Our Lord"}, {"text": "أَفْرِغْ", "translation": "Pour"}, {"text": "عَلَيْنَا", "translation": "on us"}, {"text": "صَبْرًۭا", "translation": "patience"}, {"text": "وَثَبِّتْ", "translation": "and make firm"}, {"text": "أَقْدَامَنَا", "translation": "our feet"}, {"text": "وَٱنصُرْنَا", "translation": "and help us"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "against"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَوْمِ", "translation": "the people"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ", "translation": "(who are) disbelieving"}], "sahih": "And when they went forth to [face] Goliath and his soldiers, they said, \"Our Lord, pour upon us patience and plant firmly our feet and give us victory over the disbelieving people.\""}